  HERE  -1 LIT, POSTPONE IF 7 LIT, POSTPONE ELSE 8 LIT, POSTPONE THEN EXIT,
  HERE   0 LIT, POSTPONE IF 7 LIT, POSTPONE ELSE 8 LIT, POSTPONE THEN EXIT,
