  HERE  3 LIT, POSTPONE BEGIN POSTPONE DUP ['] P COMPILE, 1 LIT, POSTPONE -
  POSTPONE DUP POSTPONE 0= POSTPONE UNTIL POSTPONE DROP EXIT,
  0 STATE !  EXECUTE CR ;
: T-LOOP  -1 STATE !
  HERE  5 LIT, 0 LIT, POSTPONE DO POSTPONE I ['] P COMPILE, POSTPONE LOOP EXIT,
  HERE  10 LIT, 0 LIT, POSTPONE DO POSTPONE I ['] P COMPILE, 3 LIT, POSTPONE +LOOP EXIT,
  HERE  0 LIT, 0 LIT, POSTPONE ?DO POSTPONE I ['] P COMPILE, POSTPONE LOOP 42 LIT, ['] P COMPILE, EXIT,
