  0 STATE !  EXECUTE CR  EXECUTE CR  EXECUTE CR  EXECUTE CR ;
: MAIN  DECIMAL  60 EMIT 60 EMIT 60 EMIT CR
  T-LIT T-IF T-BEGIN T-LOOP
  62 EMIT 62 EMIT 62 EMIT CR  0 ;
